# This directory is a byte-faithful point-in-time capture of a live website.
#
# `-text` disables git's end-of-line conversion for everything here. Without it, checking
# out on Windows rewrites LF to CRLF, which silently changes every captured file: the byte
# counts recorded in manifest.json stop matching the files they describe, and a diff
# against a re-capture shows every line as changed.
#
# A capture that git is allowed to "helpfully" normalise is no longer evidence of what the
# site actually served.
* -text
